    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        377.7682189941406,
        108.5552978515625,
        387.4507141113281
      ],
      "text": "Overall quality:",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        386.7757263183594,
        507.3309020996094,
        396.375732421875
      ],
      "text": "All studies start with one point taken off because none were RCTs. The lowest quality score achievable is 1 out of 4; no minus scores are given.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        30.368999481201172,
        392.9866943359375,
        40.87300109863281,
        544.2531127929688
      ],
      "text": "Annex 3. GRADE summary of evidence tables",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        395.7757263183594,
        661.232421875,
        405.375732421875
      ],
      "text": "Quality assessment: Based on the relative effect measure (RR or IRR) for both TST and IGRA. Studies not marked down if estimates for both tests score high on a specific GRADE quality item.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        410.4375,
        623.011474609375,
        420.1199951171875
      ],
      "text": "Other study quality considerations:  Newcastle-Ottawa Scale quality items were considered when assessing the risk of bias. One point is docked if at least one concern is present.",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        419.44500732421875,
        786.8054809570312,
        429.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "A1: Risk of bias is possible. Issues in the studies include selection bias, risk of incorporation bias, ascertainment and publication bias. Methods for ascertaining TB included microbiological methods, but not all incident TB cases had a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        428.44500732421875,
        786.848876953125,
        438.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "definite culture-confirmed diagnosis of TB. Publication bias not formally assessed, but expected to be likely. Several large prospective studies are ongoing and/or unpublished; their results were not included in this analysis; however,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        437.44500732421875,
        333.6324462890625,
        447.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "addition of their results is not expected to change the overall conclusions of this review.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        446.44500732421875,
        472.27581787109375,
        456.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "A2: Serious unexplained inconsistency of RR estimate for TST. Points taken off if serious inconsistency identified in either estimate.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        455.44500732421875,
        724.4075317382812,
        465.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "A3: Although the number of studies included is small, they involve a range of populations, including adults and children, immunocompromised people and TB contacts, providing direct evidence for these groups.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        464.44500732421875,
        592.2310180664062,
        474.0450134277344
      ],
      "text": "A4: Serious imprecision of RR estimate for TST. Lower limit of 95% CI indicates lack of predictive utility. Points docked if serious imprecision identified in either estimate.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        479.1143493652344,
        786.8939819335938,
        488.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "B1: Risk of bias is possible. Issues include selection bias, risk of incorporation bias, ascertainment and publication bias. Incorporation bias could not be ruled out in the cohort that included antepartum and postpartum women because",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        488.1143493652344,
        786.9234008789062,
        497.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "information was not available; moreover, there is concern about selection. The ART cohort study reported reference standards that do not account for index tests; however, assessors were not blinded to baseline TST results that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        497.1143493652344,
        786.8921508789062,
        506.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "were recorded in patient records. Methods for ascertaining TB included microbiological methods, but not all incident TB cases had a definitive diagnosis of TB. Publication bias not formally assessed but expected to be likely. Several",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        506.1143493652344,
        694.716552734375,
        515.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "large prospective studies are ongoing and/or are unpublished; their results were not included in this analysis; however, addition of results is not expected to change the overall conclusions of this review.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        515.1143188476562,
        306.8583679199219,
        524.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "B2: Serious unexplained inconsistency in RR estimates for both TST and IGRA.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        524.1143188476562,
        786.8480224609375,
        533.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "B3: This pooled estimate is based on only two studies: one study of HIV-infected people on ART with a median CD4+ approximately 250, and one on HIV-infected antepartum and postpartum women. No direct evidence for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        533.1143188476562,
        518.1663208007812,
        542.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "treatment-naïve patients and/or HIV-infected patients with high CD4 counts or other sub-populations of HIV-infected individuals (e.g. children).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.69279861450195,
        542.1143188476562,
        651.6217651367188,
        551.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "B4: Very serious imprecision of RR estimates for both TST and IGRA. CIs are wide and indicate both significant predictive performance and lack of predictive utility. Studies had few events.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
